[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8162.229, "timestamp": "02:16:02", "text": "ね？ なんだか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8166.63, "timestamp": "02:16:06", "text": "変な感じがするよね？ うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8174.149, "timestamp": "02:16:14", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8177.669, "timestamp": "02:16:17", "text": "それから、私が練習していて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8180.95, "timestamp": "02:16:20", "text": "カバーする予定だった曲はこれです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8185.589, "timestamp": "02:16:25", "text": "見つけられればの話ですが。 これです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8198.15, "timestamp": "02:16:38", "text": "これなら歌えるよ。 私は推測する。   よし"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8199.99, "timestamp": "02:16:39", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8201.83, "timestamp": "02:16:41", "text": "さあ、これを歌いましょう。 久しぶりですね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8213.349, "timestamp": "02:16:53", "text": "よし、"}]